  "summary": "C5 loaded the regional subset for every day from 1991-12-27 to 2004-08-31 into /tmp/sst.npz. C7 reloaded it, built hazen 90th-percentile thresholds from \u00b15-day pools around 1992\u20132002 dates, and applied the 31-day wrap-around smoothing. It then compared 2004-06-01..08-31 SST against the smoothed thresholds for day of year 153\u2013244, which need raw days 138\u2013259 and hence pools spanning May 12\u2013Sep 20 of each baseline year. It found runs and joined gaps per sea cell and wrote the mask; the climatology is never used."
